{"id":"2c7d1de20e312049","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-ricci-flow.md","title":"Ricci Flow","display":"df-ricci-flow — Ricci Flow","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ricci-flow","aliases":["58-df-ricci-flow"],"display":"df-ricci-flow — Ricci Flow","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-ricci-curvature.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ricci-flow"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ricci-flow</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ricci-flow — Ricci Flow"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c5f44e08576c6b2e\" href=\"?note=c5f44e08576c6b2e\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md\">../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f810bf542334e0d1\" href=\"?note=f810bf542334e0d1\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md\">../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" href=\"?note=04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md\">../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0b88ba4114f012c8\" href=\"?note=0b88ba4114f012c8\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-ricci-curvature.md\">../batch20/58-df-ricci-curvature.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,M,g_0,I,R,\\nabla,E,e,\\rho,n\\in V\">\\(g,M,g_0,I,R,\\nabla,E,e,\\rho,n\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RicciFlow}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RicciFlow}_S\\)</span> 保留十元接口和原参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>流形记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\">\\(S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\\)</span>、丛记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 及其切丛同构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 采用 <code>58-df-ricci-curvature</code> 的 Data 接口。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pr}_i\">\\(\\operatorname{pr}_i\\)</span> 是从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 起的有限记录投影。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(t)(p)(v,w)\">\\(g(t)(p)(v,w)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho(t)(p)(v,w)\">\\(\\rho(t)(p)(v,w)\\)</span> 是内部二阶协变张量的二元求值缩写，沿用 <code>58-df-smooth-tensor-data</code> 的有限函数元组编码。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>时间可微性在每个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,v,w\">\\(p,v,w\\)</span> 上按实数极限表达；导数的连续性按同一逐点函数族表达。端点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 的极限相对于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=[0,T)\">\\(I=[0,T)\\)</span> 取右侧极限。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f810bf542334e0d1\" href=\"?note=f810bf542334e0d1\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md\">../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RicciGeometryData}\">\\(\\mathrm{RicciGeometryData}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TangentBundleIsoData}\">\\(\\mathrm{TangentBundleIsoData}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0b88ba4114f012c8\" href=\"?note=0b88ba4114f012c8\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-ricci-curvature.md\">../batch20/58-df-ricci-curvature.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ricci\\text{-}flow}\\vdash\\quad\n&amp;\\mathrm{RicciFlow}_S(g,M,g_0,I;R,\\nabla,E,e,\\rho,n)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\n\\exists T\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\pi,D,j,S,\\tau,\\mathcal A\\;\\bigl[\nI=\\{t\\in\\mathbb R:0\\leq t&lt;T\\}\\land S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\operatorname{pr}_4(D)=S\n\\land\\mathrm{TangentBundleIsoData}_{58}(j,D)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall F\\in\\{g,R,\\nabla,e,\\rho\\}\\;\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,I,\\operatorname{ran}(F))\\land g(0)=g_0\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\n\\mathrm{RicciGeometryData}_{58}(\\rho(t),R(t),\\nabla(t),g(t),e(t),n,D,j)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v,w\\in T(S,p)\\;\\forall t\\in I\\;\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall s\\in I\\;\\bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\left(0&lt;|s-t|&lt;\\delta\\to\n\\left|\\frac{g(s)(p)(v,w)-g(t)(p)(v,w)}{s-t}\n+2\\rho(t)(p)(v,w)\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\left(|s-t|&lt;\\delta\\to\n|\\rho(s)(p)(v,w)-\\rho(t)(p)(v,w)|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\\bigr]\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ricci\\text{-}flow}\\vdash\\quad\n&amp;\\mathrm{RicciFlow}_S(g,M,g_0,I;R,\\nabla,E,e,\\rho,n)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\n\\exists T\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\pi,D,j,S,\\tau,\\mathcal A\\;\\bigl[\nI=\\{t\\in\\mathbb R:0\\leq t&lt;T\\}\\land S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\operatorname{pr}_4(D)=S\n\\land\\mathrm{TangentBundleIsoData}_{58}(j,D)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall F\\in\\{g,R,\\nabla,e,\\rho\\}\\;\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,I,\\operatorname{ran}(F))\\land g(0)=g_0\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\n\\mathrm{RicciGeometryData}_{58}(\\rho(t),R(t),\\nabla(t),g(t),e(t),n,D,j)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v,w\\in T(S,p)\\;\\forall t\\in I\\;\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall s\\in I\\;\\bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\left(0&lt;|s-t|&lt;\\delta\\to\n\\left|\\frac{g(s)(p)(v,w)-g(t)(p)(v,w)}{s-t}\n+2\\rho(t)(p)(v,w)\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\left(|s-t|&lt;\\delta\\to\n|\\rho(s)(p)(v,w)-\\rho(t)(p)(v,w)|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\\bigr]\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hamilton 的短时存在唯一性定理：闭流形上的任意光滑初始黎曼度量产生唯一的短时 Ricci 流。</li>\n<li>Short-time existence: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T &gt; 0\">\\(T &gt; 0\\)</span> depends on geometry.</li>\n<li>Perelman 的熵泛函在相应耦合演化方程下具有单调性；不能仅由裸 Ricci 流方程无条件推出。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{W}\">\\(\\mathcal{W}\\)</span>-functional: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{W}(g, f, \\tau) = \\int [\\tau(R + |\\nabla f|^2) + f - 2n] \\mu\">\\(\\mathcal{W}(g, f, \\tau) = \\int [\\tau(R + |\\nabla f|^2) + f - 2n] \\mu\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Ricci tensor 不再是依赖当前度量的隐藏下标记号；曲率、联络、载体和正交基码全部进入谓词签名。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"c5f44e08576c6b2e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"f810bf542334e0d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"04b9f5c6479b7ecd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-ricci-curvature.md","status":"resolved","id":"0b88ba4114f012c8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-ricci-curvature.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"f810bf542334e0d1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}$ 取 [[../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-ricci-curvature.md","status":"resolved","id":"0b88ba4114f012c8","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{RicciGeometryData}$、$\\mathrm{TangentBundleIsoData}$ 取 [[../batch20/58-df-ricci-curvature.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"g,M,g_0,I,R,\\nabla,E,e,\\rho,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RicciFlow}_S","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pr}_i","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"g(t)(p)(v,w)","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho(t)(p)(v,w)","display":false},{"tex":"p,v,w","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"I=[0,T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RicciGeometryData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TangentBundleIsoData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ricci\\text{-}flow}\\vdash\\quad\n&\\mathrm{RicciFlow}_S(g,M,g_0,I;R,\\nabla,E,e,\\rho,n)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\n\\exists T\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\pi,D,j,S,\\tau,\\mathcal A\\;\\bigl[\nI=\\{t\\in\\mathbb R:0\\leq t<T\\}\\land S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\operatorname{pr}_4(D)=S\n\\land\\mathrm{TangentBundleIsoData}_{58}(j,D)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall F\\in\\{g,R,\\nabla,e,\\rho\\}\\;\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,I,\\operatorname{ran}(F))\\land g(0)=g_0\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\n\\mathrm{RicciGeometryData}_{58}(\\rho(t),R(t),\\nabla(t),g(t),e(t),n,D,j)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v,w\\in T(S,p)\\;\\forall t\\in I\\;\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall s\\in I\\;\\bigl[\\\\\n&\\qquad\\left(0<|s-t|<\\delta\\to\n\\left|\\frac{g(s)(p)(v,w)-g(t)(p)(v,w)}{s-t}\n+2\\rho(t)(p)(v,w)\\right|<\\varepsilon\\right)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\left(|s-t|<\\delta\\to\n|\\rho(s)(p)(v,w)-\\rho(t)(p)(v,w)|<\\varepsilon\\right)\\bigr]\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T > 0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{W}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{W}(g, f, \\tau) = \\int [\\tau(R + |\\nabla f|^2) + f - 2n] \\mu","display":false}],"bytes":3020,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1092","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-ricci-flow.md|58-df-ricci-flow]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["c5f44e08576c6b2e","f810bf542334e0d1","36d7463d215be751","04b9f5c6479b7ecd","0b88ba4114f012c8"]}